		{"id":"free","type":"text","text":"### Independently available\n\nThese genes have no genetic prerequisite and do not unlock another gene. A partner named in **Other Prerequisites** (Oxidex Detoxase beside high-yield respiration, Lysin Resistase beside a toxin strategy, Lipron Permease beside Lipron Hydrolase) is a viability condition, not an unlock.\n\n**Metabolism.** [[Glycon Permease (GLYP)]] · [[Fluxidase (FLUX)]] · [[Anabolase (ANAB)]] · [[Lipron Permease (LIPP)]] · [[Sulfex Permease (SLFP)]] · [[Ferron Permease (FERP)]] · [[Oxidex Permease (OXDP)]] · [[Fermentate Permease (FRMP)]] · [[Siderin Permease (SIDP)]] · [[Glycon Hydrolase (GLYH)]] · [[Lipron Hydrolase (LIPH)]] · [[Azoite Hydrolase (AZOH)]] · [[Thionite Lyase (THNL)]] · [[Ferracite Reductase (FCTR)]] · [[Siderin Synthase (SIDS)]]\n\nStarter genome candidates in this list: Glycon Permease, Fluxidase, Anabolase. ATP Synthase is the starter that also sits on an unlock edge, in Respiration above.\n\n**Homeostasis.** [[Protopump (PPMP)]] · [[Acid Tolerase (ACDT)]] · [[Osmolyn Synthase (OSMS)]] · [[Aquaporin (AQUP)]] · [[Heat Shock Protein (HSP)]] · [[Cold Shock Protein (CSP)]] · [[Membrane Saturase (MSAT)]] · [[Membrane Desaturase (MDES)]] · [[Oxidex Detoxase (OXDT)]] · [[Repairase (REPR)]] · [[Lysin Resistase (LYSR)]] · [[Envelope Defensin (DEFN)]]\n\n**Morphology.** [[Envelope Thickener (ENVT)]] · [[Capsulin Synthase (CAPS)]] · [[Shape Determinant (SHPD)]] · [[Size Regulator (SIZR)]] · [[Buoyin (BUOY)]] · [[Adhesin (ADHN)]] · [[Matrixin Synthase (MTXS)]] · [[Lysin Synthase (LYSS)]] · [[Effector Injector (EFFI)]] · [[Bdellase (BDEL)]]\n\n**Motility.** [[Pilin (PILN)]]\n\n**Regulation.** [[Activator (ACTX)]] · [[Quoron Synthase (QURS)]]\n\n**Reproduction.** [[Restriction Defense (RSTD)]] · [[Sporulase (SPOR)]]\n","x":70,"y":2810,"width":1620,"height":530},
